{"id":"n63462-1-8","stage":5,"title":"소매 · 零售","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63462-1-8-1","ko":"장을 어디서 볼까?","zh":"去哪儿买菜呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장을","meaning":"市场","explanation":"장：市场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73815","senseId":"2","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장을","audio":"/audio/3847ce06b48f1fa6762d.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"볼까?","meaning":"买货","explanation":"보다：买货；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"11","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼까","audio":"/audio/ac480717af809a867fd7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2dfdb434387c361c","term":"장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3","entryId":"73815","definition":"买卖各种商品的地方。","pronunciation":["장"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"买货","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"上市场买东西。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea3d58aee957d00a676d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63462-1-8-2","ko":"시장에서 사자. 거기는 생산자들이 직접 나와서 팔기 때문에 소매보다 가격이 싸.","zh":"去市场买吧。因为那里是生产者直接出摊销售，价格比零售店更便宜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시장에서","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"1","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시장에서","audio":"/audio/a03d693d14e21500b58c.mp3"}},{"text":"사자.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사자","audio":"/audio/df410774e3dd128a2f39.mp3"}},{"text":"거기는","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那里；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"2","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거기는","audio":"/audio/ed2c5af6aa013d880f22.mp3"}},{"text":"생산자들이","meaning":"制造商，生产厂家，生产者","explanation":"생산자：制造商，生产厂家，生产者；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생산자","audio":"/audio/5ea4bc0fa009aeda8a7e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16590","senseId":"1","lemma":"생산자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생산자들이","audio":"/audio/34b3773a014afb8b6d17.mp3"}},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自。","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}},{"text":"나와서","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와서","audio":"/audio/0fa3938955583182ca19.mp3"}},{"text":"팔기","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔기","audio":"/audio/3e9fc00a8af286a78b2a.mp3"}},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때문에","audio":"/audio/870904a840bc33218066.mp3"}},{"text":"소매보다","meaning":"零售，零卖","explanation":"소매：零售，零卖；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"소매","audio":"/audio/e5e4a50ddf59a4bddc00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63462","senseId":"1","lemma":"소매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소매보다","audio":"/audio/fe708079cb640045056f.mp3"}},{"text":"가격이","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가격이","audio":"/audio/a02ba08407432d2f7b81.mp3"}},{"text":"싸.","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸","audio":"/audio/3e0d74279c237c371475.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b46fa208d9de21d2","term":"시장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3","entryId":"17193","definition":"买卖各种商品的地方。","pronunciation":["시ː장"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"5ea4bc0fa009aeda","term":"생산자","zh":"制造商，生产厂家，生产者","audio":"/audio/5ea4bc0fa009aeda8a7e.mp3","entryI